Razer Basilisk V4 Pro (Wired 1532:00E2, Wireless 1532:00E3)

From https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer/pull/2975 by Louis Rubet, with
commits by Janick Martinez Esturo and ashrynsilkstone-ui (head
a5b8804ffa90cbe2fdbbec4ce7c697dc0a8cbc17), open upstream and tested there on
the mouse itself by its authors.  Rebased onto master ea55c1b with the Pro
Type Ultra patch applied; it applied without changes.  Only the driver and
daemon files the generators read are kept; the README, udev, appstream,
pylib and fake-driver hunks are left out.

The mouse takes its control requests on interface 3 with transaction id 0x1F,
applies the settings of its active onboard profile rather than VARSTORE
(razer_get_variable_storage), ignores the plain DPI command so a DPI write
rewrites the active DPI stage (razer_set_active_stage_dpi), and has a
three-way scroll wheel on class 0x02 command 0x30/0xB0.

Delete this file once upstream master carries the pull request.

